{
  "uid": "kwaba-bornes",
  "title": "kwaba - bornes",
  "tags": [
    "kwaba",
    "openwrt",
    "collectd"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Autres dashboards kwaba",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "kwaba"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "description": "Métriques collectd des bornes OpenWrt kwaba-wifi (envoi toutes les 30 s).",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "borne",
        "label": "Borne",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(collectd_uptime, instance)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(collectd_uptime, instance)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "interface",
        "label": "Interface",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(collectd_interface_if_octets_rx_total{instance=~\"$borne\"}, interface)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(collectd_interface_if_octets_rx_total{instance=~\"$borne\"}, interface)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "br-lan",
            "mesh0",
            "wan",
            "lan",
            "lan1",
            "lan2",
            "lan3",
            "lan4",
            "eth0"
          ],
          "value": [
            "br-lan",
            "mesh0",
            "wan",
            "lan",
            "lan1",
            "lan2",
            "lan3",
            "lan4",
            "eth0"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Vue d'ensemble",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Lecture",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Mesures **collectd** de chaque borne, envoyées toutes les **30 s**. En haut : **Borne** et **Interface** (par défaut les liens physiques et le mesh ; VLAN et SSID au choix). Une borne absente du tableau n'envoie plus depuis plus d'une minute (éteinte, sans Internet). Repères au calme : CPU ~4 %, mémoire ~20 %, puces Wi-Fi 73 à 80 °C, ping routeur < 1 ms (câble) ou 2 à 6 ms (mesh), 8 voisins mesh. Survoler le **i** d'un panneau pour le détail. Doc : docs/metriques.md (kwaba-wifi)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bornes qui envoient",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Bornes dont collectd a envoyé des mesures dans les 2 dernières minutes.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(collectd_uptime{instance=~\"$borne\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "État des bornes",
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 20,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (collectd_uptime{instance=~\"$borne\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (collectd_load_shortterm{instance=~\"$borne\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (sum by (instance) (collectd_cpu_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",type!=\"idle\"}) / count by (instance) (collectd_cpu_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",type=\"user\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (collectd_memory_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",memory=\"used\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (sum by (instance) (collectd_iwinfo_stations{instance=~\"$borne\",iwinfo!~\"mesh.*\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (sum by (instance) (collectd_iwinfo_stations{instance=~\"$borne\",iwinfo=~\"mesh.*\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "G",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (max by (instance) (collectd_sensors_temperature{instance=~\"$borne\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "H",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (max by (instance) (collectd_ping{instance=~\"$borne\",ping=\"1.1.1.1\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "I",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (max by (instance) (collectd_ping{instance=~\"$borne\",ping=\"192.168.1.1\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "J",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (time() - max by (instance) (kwaba_sauvegarde_timestamp_seconds{instance=~\"$borne\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "K",
          "expr": "max by (instance) (100 * sum by (instance) (collectd_df_df_complex{instance=~\"$borne\",df=\"overlay\",type=\"used\"}) / sum by (instance) (collectd_df_df_complex{instance=~\"$borne\",df=\"overlay\"}))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "job": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "pod": true,
              "service": true,
              "container": true,
              "memory": true,
              "ping": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "instance": "Borne",
              "Value #A": "Uptime",
              "Value #B": "Charge 1 min",
              "Value #C": "CPU %",
              "Value #D": "Mémoire %",
              "Value #E": "Clients Wi-Fi",
              "Value #F": "Voisins mesh",
              "Value #G": "Temp. max °C",
              "Value #H": "Ping Internet ms",
              "Value #I": "Ping routeur ms",
              "Value #J": "Dernière sauvegarde",
              "Value #K": "Flash /overlay %"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "center"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Uptime"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Charge 1 min"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CPU %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Mémoire %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Clients Wi-Fi"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Voisins mesh"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Temp. max °C"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "celsius"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Ping Internet ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Ping routeur ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Dernière sauvegarde"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Flash /overlay %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CPU %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 60
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 85
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Borne",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Une ligne par borne : uptime, charge 1 min, CPU (moyenne des cœurs hors idle), mémoire utilisée, clients Wi-Fi (hors mesh), voisins mesh (8 attendus à CDI), température la plus haute des puces Wi-Fi, ping vers Internet (1.1.1.1) et vers le routeur, âge de la dernière sauvegarde, flash utilisée."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Système",
      "id": 6,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU utilisé (%)",
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Moyenne des cœurs, tous états sauf idle (plugin cpu, ValuesPercentage).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (collectd_cpu_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",type!=\"idle\"}) / count by (instance) (collectd_cpu_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",type=\"user\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Charge (1 min)",
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Nombre moyen de tâches en attente du processeur (4 cœurs) : < 1 au calme, monte pendant le benchmark.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "collectd_load_shortterm{instance=~\"$borne\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mémoire utilisée (%)",
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Mémoire utilisée hors cache. Au-delà de 85 % : risque de redémarrage (manque de mémoire).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "collectd_memory_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",memory=\"used\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Température des puces Wi-Fi (°C)",
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Plugin sensors (hwmon) : capteurs des puces Wi-Fi ath10k. L'IPQ4019 n'a pas de zone thermique (plugin thermal) sous OpenWrt.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "plugin sensors pas encore actif"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(collectd_sensors_temperature{instance=~\"$borne\"}, \"puce\", \"radio intégrée a000000\", \"sensors\", \".*isa-a000000\"), \"puce\", \"radio intégrée a800000\", \"sensors\", \".*isa-a800000\"), \"puce\", \"3e radio (PCI)\", \"sensors\", \".*pci.*\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{puce}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU par état (%)",
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "softirq élevé = beaucoup de trafic réseau traité par le processeur.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (instance, type) (collectd_cpu_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",type!=\"idle\"}) / ignoring(type) group_left count by (instance) (collectd_cpu_percent{instance=~\"$borne\",type=\"user\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{type}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connexions suivies (conntrack)",
      "id": 12,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Connexions suivies par le pare-feu (surtout sur le routeur : clients vers Internet).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "collectd_conntrack{instance=~\"$borne\",conntrack=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "collectd_conntrack_percent{instance=~\"$borne\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} % utilisé",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Changements de contexte /s",
      "id": 13,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Activité du noyau : monte avec le trafic (benchmark, test de charge).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "rate(collectd_contextswitch_total{instance=~\"$borne\"}[2m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Espace flash /overlay utilisé (%)",
      "id": 14,
